        notes: 'Verified against TWOIAF, The Targaryen Kings section (Aegon I). Note: TWOIAF spells the name ''Valaena'' but GEDCOM imported as ''Velena''. Mother of Aegon the Conqueror, Visenya, and Rhaenys. Source text: He was the only son, and second child, of Aerion, Lord of Dragonstone, and Lady Valaena of House Velaryon, herself half-Targaryen on her mother''s side.'
